+// Aerium: send only the headers a DoH query needs. RFC 8484 section 6.1:
+// "Implementations SHOULD NOT set non-essential HTTP headers in DoH client
+// requests." Ported from Cromite. See the patch description.
+LOAD_FLAG(MINIMAL_HEADERS, 1 << 20)
+
 // See note at top of file about why adding LoadFlags is often a bad idea.
